  "scenario": "固定群聊双玩家，p1 激活涅槃诀并与高气血 p2 长线战斗，断言「施展大招【涅槃重生】」及其庇护文本；min_action_index=5；声明 deterministic: true + seed（确定性优先），必要时 --repeat 采样兜底。",
  "tags": [
    "pvp",
    "ultimate",
    "content-design",
    "sampled"
  ],
  "deterministic": true,
  "seed": 42,
  "conversation": {
